NOTE Standard track re-timed from the official TOS-en.srt (offset −190 s). Speaker attributions marked "review" need a human check against the picture.

c001
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.000
<v Director>Are you ready?

c002
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.333
<v Director>Of course you're ready, you're a rockstar.

c003
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.333
<v Director>How's it looking, Barley?

c004
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
<v Barley>We should have about ten minutes...

c005
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.000
<v Director>Well that's perfect.

c006
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.500
<v Director>We're on in one! All systems go!

c007
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.800
<v Director>Yeah you, go!

c008
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
<v Director>Go! Move your asses! Go go go!

c009
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
<v Director>I love it! Come on, go!

c010
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.000
<v Director>That's nice.

c011
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.833
<v Director>Nothing to worry about.

c012
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.000
<v Director>Thom.

c013
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.000
<v Director>There she is.

c014
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.500
<v Director>Now.

c015
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.000
<v Director>You love her.

c016
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.500
<v Director>She is your passion!

c017
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.333
<v Director>Be tender to her.

c018
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.500
<v Director>Be honest! Eh- be tender.

c019
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.000
<v Director>Remind her what love is.
